From b36ef7c50c6f17e6d2556d0949e8dc465e186092 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stefane Fermigier <sf@abilian.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 20:04:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] DOCX: an extended chart linked as a classic chart is read as
 one

Apache POI links an Office 2016 chart's part (cx:chartSpace) with the
classic chart relationship and content type. x2t read it as a classic
chart, found none, and drew neither it nor its fallback picture; a save
wrote an empty chart in its place. Such a part is now read by its root
element, the drawing that refers to it written as an extended chart,
and an extended chart with no fallback no longer turns the next drawing
into an alternative. After ElixirOffice 0.7.3 and 0.8.0
(leag1234/core 561a9a85f, 8743e3006).
---
